<title>USA: N.Y. certificated cotton stocks drop to 160,792.</title>
<headline>N.Y. certificated cotton stocks drop to 160,792.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Certificated cotton stocks deliverable against New York Cotton Exchange's No. 2 cotton futures contract as of July 1 totaled 160,792 bales, down from 161,740 bales the previous session.</p>
<p>There were four bales issued, no bales awaiting review, 952 cancellations, and 23,122 decertification orders.</p>
<p>-- New York Commodity Desk, 212-859-1640</p>
</text>
